                <http://www.mirabileweb.it/author/guillelmus-de-boldensele-m-1339-ca--author/22030> ;
        <http://imagoarchive.it/ilrmoo/R17_created>
                <http://www.mirabileweb.it/title/liber-de-quibusdam-ultramarinis-partibus-et-praeci-title/7772> ;
        <http://imagoarchive.it/ilrmoo/R18_created>
                <https://imagoarchive.it/ontology/resources/manuscript/mnchen/bayerischestaatsbibliothek/clm_903/174r195v> , <https://imagoarchive.it/ontology/resources/manuscript/warsaw/bibliotekanarodowa/8052/209r221v> , <https://imagoarchive.it/ontology/resources/manuscript/basel/universittsbibliothek/e_iii_20/1v26r> , <https://imagoarchive.it/ontology/resources/manuscript/colmar/bibliothquedesdominicains/35_(228)/12r29r> , <https://imagoarchive.it/ontology/resources/manuscript/wrocaw/bibliotekauniwersytecka/i.q.37_(850)/378r401v> , <https://imagoarchive.it/ontology/resources/manuscript/wien/sterreichischenationalbibliothek/ser._nova_3624/13r35v> , <https://imagoarchive.it/ontology/resources/manuscript/wien/sterreichischenationalbibliothek/523/132> , <https://imagoarchive.it/ontology/resources/manuscript/wolfenbttel/herzogaugustbibliothek/weiss._40_(4124)/95r110r> , <https://imagoarchive.it/ontology/resources/manuscript/sgravenhage/koninklijkebibliotheek/75.j.53_(z_183)/1r14r> , <https://imagoarchive.it/ontology/resources/manuscript/utrecht/bibliotheekderrijksuniversiteit/737_(5.b.2)/160175r> , <https://imagoarchive.it/ontology/resources/manuscript/praha/archivpraskhohradu/knihovna_metropolitní_kapituly_g._xlii_(1036)/140r152v> , <https://imagoarchive.it/ontology/resources/manuscript/mnchen/bayerischestaatsbibliothek/clm_27006/231r244r> , <https://imagoarchive.it/ontology/resources/manuscript/lille/mdiathquemunicipalejeanlvy/418_(624)/236r248r> , <https://imagoarchive.it/ontology/resources/manuscript/mnchen/bayerischestaatsbibliothek/clm_22377/190r199r> , <https://imagoarchive.it/ontology/resources/manuscript/cittdelvaticano/bibliotecaapostolicavaticana/ott._lat._2087/88r103r> , <https://imagoarchive.it/ontology/resources/manuscript/minneapolismn/jamesfordbellcollection/1424/co/64r88r> , <https://imagoarchive.it/ontology/resources/manuscript/mnchen/bayerischestaatsbibliothek/clm_18621/83r122r> , <https://imagoarchive.it/ontology/resources/manuscript/wien/sterreichischenationalbibliothek/3529/132r153r> , <https://imagoarchive.it/ontology/resources/manuscript/namur/musedesartsanciens/fonds_de_la_ville_50_i/164v179r> , <https://imagoarchive.it/ontology/resources/manuscript/bruxelles/kbrbibliothqueroyaledebelgique/7435_(8779)/1r28r> , <https://imagoarchive.it/ontology/resources/manuscript/praha/archivpraskhohradu/knihovna_metropolitní_kapituly_n._xiii_(1537)/1r14r> , <https://imagoarchive.it/ontology/resources/manuscript/leiden/universiteitsbibliotheek/b.p.l._191b/168r183v> , <https://imagoarchive.it/ontology/resources/manuscript/gieen/universittsbibliothek/159/1r12v> ;
        :has_abstract  "Guglielmo di Boldensele, frate domenicano originario della Sassonia, tra il 1332 e il 1336 compì un viaggio nel Mediterraneo orientale, forse una missione intrapresa sotto gli auspici papali per una crociata futura. Nel corso del suo  viaggio Guglielmo sostò a Costantinopoli, Rodi, Cipro, incontrò l'imperatore bizantino Andronico III, fece tappa a Gerusalemme, dove divenne cavaliere del Santo Sepolcro, e si recò infine in Egitto. Il suo diario di viaggio fu presto tradotto in francese e in tedesco e influenzò gli scritti di Ludolf von Sudheim e Jean de Mandeville. " .

