        :has_secondary_source  "<li><a href='https://imagoarchive.it/bibliografia.html#mirabile'>MIRABILE</a>, http://www.mirabileweb.it/title/topographia-hiberniae-title/4005 </li><li><a href='https://imagoarchive.it/bibliografia.html#sumithra-looking-east-and-west'>SUMITHRA (PhD thesis) 2009</a>, pp. 327-328. </li><li><a href='https://imagoarchive.it/bibliografia.html#borrego-sargent-visions-and-revisions'>BORREGO SARGENT (PhD thesis) 2009</a>,  </li>" ;
