<https://imagoarchive.it/ontology/resources/manuscript/basel/universittsbibliothek/b_x_14/arebv>
        rdf:type               :Manuscript ;
        <http://erlangen-crm.org/211015/P102_has_title>
                [ <http://erlangen-crm.org/211015/P190_has_symbolic_content>
                          "" ] ;
        <http://erlangen-crm.org/211015/P1_is_identified_by>
                <https://imagoarchive.it/ontology/resources/signature/ms-2184> ;
        <http://erlangen-crm.org/211015/P3_has_note>
                "Il manoscritto, copiato a Basilea, trasmette i libri I, 95-147 e libro III, 1-2. Il codice trasmette inoltre: Basilii episcopi Cappadociae regula ad monachos, ff. 2r-52r; Nicola VI papa, Bulla, ff. 52v-57r;  Collectio sermonum veterum patrum f.58R-94r; De potestate super sorores vicatiorum et confessorum, ff. 95v-96v; Agostino, Sermones, ff. 97r-101r; Henricus de Vistingen, Epistola ad decanum s. Castoris Confluentiae, ff. 102v-103r; Hermannus de Minda, Ad priorissam et sorores, ff. 103v-104r; Agostino, Sermo 356, ff. 105r-106v; Bullae ff.106v-107v; Ad potestatem poenitentiariorum spectantes, ff.108r-111v;  De fide catholica contra Judaeos, ff.114r-163r; Gregorio IX papa, Bullae variae, ff. 165r-177v; Bertholdus de Sternberg, Confirmatio bullae a Martino IV papa, ff. 177v-178v; Eidem de pace inter fratres OP. et Minores observanda ff.180r-182r; Innocenzo III, Ordinatio expeditionis Terrae sanctae, ff. 182r-185r; Otto de Monteferrato, Statuta reformationis OSB et Augustini, ad claustra in Argentin, ff.185r-188v; Laudes mulieris cuiusdam ignotae pro iis quae fratribus conventus nescio, ff.188v-189v; Formula epistolae encyclicae per magistrum provinciae Teutoniae de procuratoribus, ff.191r-192r; Sermo, ff.192r-193r; Innocenzo IV, Variae bullae, ff. 169r-217v; Albanensis episcopus, Epistola priori provinciali Lombardiae, ff. 217v-219r; Bullae, ff. 220r-308v; Epistolae praelatorum, ff. 308v-313r; Bullae, ff. 313r-314r. I fogli Ar e Bv sono volanti e incollati nella parte posteriore del codice. " ;
        <http://erlangen-crm.org/211015/P46_is_composed_of>
                <https://imagoarchive.it/ontology/resources/folios/mf-2184> ;
        <http://erlangen-crm.org/211015/P50_has_current_keeper>
                <http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q81164649> ;
