        <http://erlangen-crm.org/211015/P3_has_note>
                "Il manoscritto membranaceo trasmette i libri I-III, 22 dell'Imago mundi e riporta inoltre: Questiones super meteororum Aristotelis, ff. 1r-33r; Quaestiones, ff. 33r-35v; Notae de natura rerum, ff. 36r-36v; Egidio Romano, De materia caeli, ff. 37r-43v, Duae quaestiones de intentionibus, ff. 43v-44v; Alberto Magno, Mineralis, ff. 57r-85r; Commentarius in De anima Aristotelis, ff. 86r-100v; Commentarius in De memoria et reminiscentia Aristotelis, ff. 101r-101v; Scripta super secundo minoris Prisciani, ff. 102r-113v; Notabilia super veterem artem et posteriorum, ff. 114r-120v; Ruggero Bacone, De constructione partium, ff. 122r-129v; Duo tractatus de grammatica, ff. 129v-133v. " ;
        <http://erlangen-crm.org/211015/P46_is_composed_of>
                <https://imagoarchive.it/ontology/resources/folios/mf-2131> ;
