<https://imagoarchive.it/ontology/resources/incipit_text/mit-1594>
        rdf:type             <http://erlangen-crm.org/211015/E90_Symbolic_Object> ;
        <http://erlangen-crm.org/211015/P190_has_symbolic_content>
                "Indulgentie et stationes omnium ecclesiarum in et extra almam urbem Romanam secundum ordinem kalendarii et mensium capitulo Wyndensemensis, ordinis canonicorum regularium sancti Augustini in Alemannia, et eidem subiectis concesse a summis pontificibus, videlicet Martino V, Eugenio IV, Sixto VI et Innocentio VIII, et a nonnullis a latere legatis, videlicet Petro Cameracensi et Nicolao tituli ad vincula Petri cardinalibus. " ;
        :is_text_incipit_of  <https://imagoarchive.it/ontology/resources/manifestation/manuscript/mm-1594> .

