<https://imagoarchive.it/ontology/resources/incipit_text/mit-1275>
        rdf:type             <http://erlangen-crm.org/211015/E90_Symbolic_Object> ;
        <http://erlangen-crm.org/211015/P190_has_symbolic_content>
                "Liber primus Domini Marci Pauli Veneti de mirabilibus Orientalium regionum Qualiter et quare Dominus Nicolaus Pauli de Veneciis et dominus Matheus transierunt ad partes Orientales. Capitulum primum. Tempore quo Balduinus princeps septrum Constantinopolitani " ;
