<https://imagoarchive.it/ontology/resources/manuscript/mnchen/bayerischestaatsbibliothek/clm_5030/261r272v>
        rdf:type               :Manuscript ;
        <http://erlangen-crm.org/211015/P102_has_title>
                [ <http://erlangen-crm.org/211015/P190_has_symbolic_content>
                          "" ] ;
        <http://erlangen-crm.org/211015/P1_is_identified_by>
                <https://imagoarchive.it/ontology/resources/signature/ms-1543> ;
        <http://erlangen-crm.org/211015/P3_has_note>
                "Il manoscritto cartaceo è formato da 287 ff. e misura 140x90 mm. Il codice trasmette anche: Pseudo-Bernardo di Chiaravalle, Scala claustralium; Ugo di San Vittore, Compendia de meditatione; Agostino, De laude psalmorum; Iohannes de Turrecremata, De nuptiis spiritualibus; Nicolaus Graetz, De articulis fidei; Iohannes Nider, Admonitio ad spiritualem vitam; Agostino, Speculum peccatoris; Nicolaus von Dinkelsbuhl, Sermo de litania; Iohannes Schlitpacher, Praeparatio sacerdotis; Innocenzo III, Statuta monachorum. " ;
        <http://erlangen-crm.org/211015/P46_is_composed_of>
                <https://imagoarchive.it/ontology/resources/folios/mf-1543> ;
