        <http://erlangen-crm.org/211015/P3_has_note>
                "Il manoscritto è formato da 276 ff. e trasmette inoltre: Telesforo da Cosenza, Libellus, ff. 1r-38v; Tractatus de Antichristo, ff. 39r-42v; Miraculum de equo albo in proelio viso, ff. 43r-43v; Sententiae pleraeque metricae de ortu et de morte, ff. 44r-44v; Querelae Christi erga genus humanum, ff. 45r-48v; Philippi ducis Burg. ambasciatoris propositio ad Imp. Fredericum III contra Turcam, ff. 49r-52v; Epistola del Prete Gianni, ff. 53r-56r; Rabbi Samuel, Epistula de captivate Judaeorum, ff.56r-69v; Tractatus contra Judaeos, ff. 70r-86v; Epistola del Prete Gianni, ff. 87r-90r; De stella quae tribus Regibus apparuit, ff. 90r-90v; Isidorus Thessalonicensis Metropolita, Constantinopolis capta, f. 91r-93v; Tractatus de miseria humanae, ff. 94r-98v; Francesco Foscari, Epistola ad Imp. Fridericum a.1453,  ff. 99r-100v; Taxa Sacrae poenitentiariae, ff. 120r-123v; Tractatus de multiplici sonscientia, ff. 130r-132v; Giovanni da Capestrano, Tractatus de Christi fidelibus,  ff. 133r-175v; Quaestio, ff. 176r-176v; Tractatus contra haeresin in Bohemia exortam, ff. 177r-184v; Sententia contra Johannes Huss, ff. 185r-187r;  Errores s. articuli Graecorum in concilio Basileensi praesentati, ff. 196r-199v; Decimatio a Paulo V papa, ff. 200r-213v; Tractatus de Christianorum monarchia, ff. 214r-229v; Tractatus de vita et origine SS trium Regum, ff. 230r-263v; Liber Etymologiarum, ff. 283r-286v." ;
        <http://erlangen-crm.org/211015/P46_is_composed_of>
                <https://imagoarchive.it/ontology/resources/folios/mf-2001> ;
        <http://erlangen-crm.org/211015/P50_has_current_keeper>
                <http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q256507> ;
